{
    "title": "PredictWind - Marine Forecasts",
    "description": "Accurate marine weather forecasts and powerful tools utilizing wind, wave and currents, save you time, keep you safe and ensure you get the most out of every day on the water.\r\n\r\nAccess all of the world\u2019s top ranking forecast models for reliable and accurate wind and weather data, including ECMWF, SPIRE, UKMO, GFS and more. Our very own PWG & PWE models offer incredible accuracy and a record-breaking 1km resolution showing wind in detail.\r\n\r\nView high resolution marine weather maps for wind, gust, CAPE, wave, rain, cloud, pressure, air temperature, sea temperature, ocean data and solunar. Suitable for sailing yacht, powerboat and any other marine weather activity.\r\n\r\nIn addition to marine forecasts, PredictWind also provides a suite of powerful marine weather tools to save you time and keep you safe at sea using Wind, Wave, Tidal and Ocean currents.\r\n\r\nWeather Routing takes your start and end points then calculates your route factoring in tides, currents, wind and wave data, depth and your Sailing Yacht or Powerboats unique dimensions to give you the best route for comfort or speed.\r\n\r\nDeparture Planning quickly summarizes the forecast marine weather conditions you\u2019ll encounter along your route if leaving on day 1, 2, 3, or 4. Use this data to select the perfect departure date, every time for your Sailing Yacht or Powerboat.\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL FEATURES\r\n- Daily Briefing: Powerful marine weather data condensed into a simple text forecast.\r\n- Maps: High resolution forecasts maps with animated streamlines, wind barbs or arrows.\r\n- Tables: The ultimate dashboard for detailed analysis of Wind, Wave, Rain and more.\r\n- Graphs: Compare multiple marine forecasts at the same time.\r\n- Live Wind Observations and Webcams: Know what\u2019s happening with the weather right now at your local spot.\r\n- Local Knowledge: Hear about the best marine spots, amenities and activities at your destination.\r\n- Weather Alerts: Set your preferences then get alerts when conditions are just the way you like them for Wind, wave and other parameters.\r\n- Ocean Data: See what\u2019s happening under the waves with ocean and tidal currents, and sea temperature.\r\n- GPS Tracking: Get a free customized GPS tracking page for your blog or website showing wind data overlaid.\r\n- AIS Data: View over 280,000 vessels worldwide on the AIS network to see marine traffic.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Accurate marine weather forecasts and powerful tools utilizing wind, wave and currents, save you time, keep you safe and ensure you get the most out of every day on the water.<br><br>Access all of the world\u2019s top ranking forecast models for reliable and accurate wind and weather data, including ECMWF, SPIRE, UKMO, GFS and more. Our very own PWG &amp; PWE models offer incredible accuracy and a record-breaking 1km resolution showing wind in detail.<br><br>View high resolution marine weather maps for wind, gust, CAPE, wave, rain, cloud, pressure, air temperature, sea temperature, ocean data and solunar. Suitable for sailing yacht, powerboat and any other marine weather activity.<br><br>In addition to marine forecasts, PredictWind also provides a suite of powerful marine weather tools to save you time and keep you safe at sea using Wind, Wave, Tidal and Ocean currents.<br><br>Weather Routing takes your start and end points then calculates your route factoring in tides, currents, wind and wave data, depth and your Sailing Yacht or Powerboats unique dimensions to give you the best route for comfort or speed.<br><br>Departure Planning quickly summarizes the forecast marine weather conditions you\u2019ll encounter along your route if leaving on day 1, 2, 3, or 4. Use this data to select the perfect departure date, every time for your Sailing Yacht or Powerboat.<br><br>ADDITIONAL FEATURES<br>- Daily Briefing: Powerful marine weather data condensed into a simple text forecast.<br>- Maps: High resolution forecasts maps with animated streamlines, wind barbs or arrows.<br>- Tables: The ultimate dashboard for detailed analysis of Wind, Wave, Rain and more.<br>- Graphs: Compare multiple marine forecasts at the same time.<br>- Live Wind Observations and Webcams: Know what\u2019s happening with the weather right now at your local spot.<br>- Local Knowledge: Hear about the best marine spots, amenities and activities at your destination.<br>- Weather Alerts: Set your preferences then get alerts when conditions are just the way you like them for Wind, wave and other parameters.<br>- Ocean Data: See what\u2019s happening under the waves with ocean and tidal currents, and sea temperature.<br>- GPS Tracking: Get a free customized GPS tracking page for your blog or website showing wind data overlaid.<br>- AIS Data: View over 280,000 vessels worldwide on the AIS network to see marine traffic.",
